  "spells": null,
  "conversionNotes": [
    "Bear Hug is an opposed D6 + Strength roll, not a 'natural 6' style check; converted to d12 + doubled Strength so the dice scale with the doubled stats.",
    "Youths are 0-2 Heroes (not henchmen) costing 15 gc; starting experience not printed, assumed 0.",
    "Vodka and Bear-Claw Necklace are special equipment (Kislevite Heroes only) described in the text, not on the printed equipment list; added to the Kislev Warrior list as misc with the base cost and dice part in the note. Streltsi and henchmen cannot take them.",
    "Item names copied as printed (Kislev list capitalises 'Morning Star', 'Light Armour', 'Heavy Armour', 'Throwing Knives', 'Duelling Pistol'). Sample warband mentions clubs but Club is not on any printed list.",
    "Warband has 'Hated' Cossacks flagged as Hatred (rule name Hate Chaos). Ancient Enemies prevents alliances with chaotic warbands only.",
    "Skill tables read from the grid: Druzhina Captain = Combat, Shooting, Academic, Strength, Speed; Esaul = Combat, Shooting, Speed; Bear Tamer = Combat, Strength, Speed; Youth = Combat, Strength, Speed.",
    "Druzhina Captain's inherited item and 'Heavy Armour' cost not doubled; the full ancestral-item rules are summarised."
  ]
